  "definition": "Layoff",
  "effectiveDate": "2025-12-01",
  "historyNote": "#5373, eff 4-27-92; ss by #6729, eff 4-21-98; renumbered by #10238 (from Per 102.34); renumbered by #10801 (from Per 102.35); ss by #13667, eff 6-22-23 (formerly Per 102.38); renumbered by #14132-A; ss by #14434 (formerly Per 102.44), eff 12-1-25",
